{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52045","headline":"过乡学 · 王绩","name":"过乡学","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杖蔾寻学舍，抠衣向讲堂。\n杏坛花正落，槐市叶新长。\n聚徒疑鲁国，游人即郑乡。\n先生坐不议，弟子入成行。\n邴元（韩理洲云应作「邴原」）供洒埽，刘俊脱衣裳。\n组带填中塾，青衿溢下庠。\n佩猳情已变，术蚁艺应光。\n寄语安眠者，无爲粪二墙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}